    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n50759" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἱππο-θόρος</span></b> , ὁ, (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">θόρνυμι</span>) <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>covering mares</i>, esp. of a he-ass kept for breeding
